{"4261070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deadrock Salvation", "steam_appid": 4261070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saddle up for sin, survival, and redemption in the wildest frontier the West has ever seen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The frontier of <strong>Deadrock County</strong> is a place where justice rides on the edge of a gun barrel and temptation hides behind every saloon door. In <strong>Deadrock Salvation</strong>, you step into the boots of <strong>Colt Dawson</strong>, a weary gunslinger searching for a second chance in a land that’s forgotten the meaning of mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>open-world 3D Western RPG</strong> invites you to roam a living, breathing frontier—where every dusty trail leads to adventure, danger, and desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261070/extras/8607a6fba10ffc90ff32372e260dcd99.poster.avif?t=1767900207\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261070/extras/8607a6fba10ffc90ff32372e260dcd99.webm?t=1767900207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261070/extras/8607a6fba10ffc90ff32372e260dcd99.mp4?t=1767900207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Thrilling Gunfights</strong><br>Engage in fast-paced, skill-based duels and large-scale shootouts using authentic Western firearms. Every bullet counts when lawlessness rules the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌵 <strong>Expansive Open World</strong><br>Explore rugged canyons, outlaw hideouts, ghost towns, and frontier settlements across a vast 3D environment powered by modern Unity technology. Every location holds secrets, quests, and choices that shape your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💃 <strong>Meet the Women of the West</strong><br>Forge relationships—or rivalries—with a cast of <strong>beautiful, strong-willed women</strong> who define the heart of the frontier. From saloon owners and ranchers to mysterious travelers, each character offers romance, loyalty, or betrayal… depending on how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261070/extras/c9cd25f2f49945195d8ba4917dc20ebc.avif?t=1767900207\" width=602 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Western-Themed Quests &amp; Morality</strong><br>Ride across the badlands, defend settlers, hunt bandits, or join them. Your decisions write your legend—hero, outlaw, or something in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏜️ <strong>Dynamic Reputation &amp; Faction System</strong><br>Every action has consequence. Earn fame, infamy, or redemption as townsfolk react to your deeds and alliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 <strong>Atmospheric Soundtrack &amp; Voice Acting</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a fully voice-acted narrative featuring an original Western score that captures both the grit and romance of the frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261070/extras/6ba70bb17a56d1a490953538d6ad53b3.avif?t=1767900207\" width=602 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The West is calling, gunslinger.</strong><br>Will you earn <strong>Salvation</strong>… or become a legend drenched in blood?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saddle up for sin, survival, and redemption in the wildest frontier the West has ever seen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The frontier of <strong>Deadrock County</strong> is a place where justice rides on the edge of a gun barrel and temptation hides behind every saloon door. In <strong>Deadrock Salvation</strong>, you step into the boots of <strong>Colt Dawson</strong>, a weary gunslinger searching for a second chance in a land that’s forgotten the meaning of mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>open-world 3D Western RPG</strong> invites you to roam a living, breathing frontier—where every dusty trail leads to adventure, danger, and desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261070/extras/8607a6fba10ffc90ff32372e260dcd99.poster.avif?t=1767900207\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261070/extras/8607a6fba10ffc90ff32372e260dcd99.webm?t=1767900207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261070/extras/8607a6fba10ffc90ff32372e260dcd99.mp4?t=1767900207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Thrilling Gunfights</strong><br>Engage in fast-paced, skill-based duels and large-scale shootouts using authentic Western firearms. Every bullet counts when lawlessness rules the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌵 <strong>Expansive Open World</strong><br>Explore rugged canyons, outlaw hideouts, ghost towns, and frontier settlements across a vast 3D environment powered by modern Unity technology. Every location holds secrets, quests, and choices that shape your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💃 <strong>Meet the Women of the West</strong><br>Forge relationships—or rivalries—with a cast of <strong>beautiful, strong-willed women</strong> who define the heart of the frontier. From saloon owners and ranchers to mysterious travelers, each character offers romance, loyalty, or betrayal… depending on how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261070/extras/c9cd25f2f49945195d8ba4917dc20ebc.avif?t=1767900207\" width=602 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Western-Themed Quests &amp; Morality</strong><br>Ride across the badlands, defend settlers, hunt bandits, or join them. Your decisions write your legend—hero, outlaw, or something in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏜️ <strong>Dynamic Reputation &amp; Faction System</strong><br>Every action has consequence. Earn fame, infamy, or redemption as townsfolk react to your deeds and alliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 <strong>Atmospheric Soundtrack &amp; Voice Acting</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a fully voice-acted narrative featuring an original Western score that captures both the grit and romance of the frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261070/extras/6ba70bb17a56d1a490953538d6ad53b3.avif?t=1767900207\" width=602 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The West is calling, gunslinger.</strong><br>Will you earn <strong>Salvation</strong>… or become a legend drenched in blood?</p>", "short_description": "The frontier of Deadrock Salvation is an immersive Open World RPG on the edge of a gun barrel and temptation hides behind every saloon door. In DS, you step into the boots of Colt Dawson, a weary gunslinger searching for a second chance in a land that’s forgotten the meaning of mercy.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_ima